            "url": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/MacBook_Pro_%2814-inch%2C_M5%2C_Space_Black%29.jpg/960px-MacBook_Pro_%2814-inch%2C_M5%2C_Space_Black%29.jpg?utm_campaign=index&utm_content=thumbnail&utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org",
            "credit": "资料图：搭载苹果芯片的MacBook Pro，并非发布演示设备。AzureSaturn 摄，CC0 1.0，维基共享资源。"
